+# Observation gates (host callbacks in dm/host/hle_pillarbox.c, numbers as there/dm.h): with the wide-viewport clamp cut, the picture still reaches the screen confined to a
+# centered 16:9 (a 1578.67x888 content rect inside the 1920x888 texture, host-side; the PC shader fix's five-piece answer names the remaining candidates), so these record what
